# Voice Pipeline

```
STT → Normalizer → Legality (chess.js) → Apply
         ↑              ↓
    Disambiguation ← Clock Freeze
```

## Rules

- On-device STT primary; cloud fallback only
- `normalizeMove` is a pure, table-tested function
- Disambiguation responses re-enter the **same** pipeline — no shortcut
- Clock freezes instantly on ambiguous/illegal input
- Stockfish WASM off main thread

## Homophones

night→N, rook→R, bishop→B, queen→Q, king→K

